<title>UK: SNOOKER-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP SEMIFINALS SCORES.</title>
<headline>SNOOKER-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP SEMIFINALS SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>SHEFFIELD, England 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Latest scores on</p>
<p>Friday in the semifinals of the world professional snooker</p>
<p>championship (prefix number denotes seeding; best of 33 frames)</p>
<p>1-Stephen Hendry (Scotland) and 12-James Wattana (Thailand)</p>
<p>level 8-8. Frame scores (Hendry first): 0-136 10-92 55-42 73-8</p>
<p>78-21 114-6 122-0 38-74 60-45 101-0 25-91 60-63 71-1 18-61 0-83</p>
<p>42-74.</p>
<p>7-Ken Doherty (Ireland) leads 14-Alain Robidoux</p>
<p>(Canada)12-7. Frame scores (Doherty first): 104-5 8-79 33-78</p>
<p>99-0 0-131 62-26 23-67 77-1 88-34 60-2 73-44 87-14 82-19 36-92</p>
<p>78-6 74-31 1-97 60-25 48-62.</p>
</text>
